                                                "text": "The Kremlin announced plans to increase funding for museums and the arts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1db6a46-b4c2-40e2-a811-dd82380b7de4",
                                                "sense_id": "e4977973-17c1-3846-b188-483c1c031fc6",
                                                "text": "Over the course of the war in Ukraine, the Kremlin has drawn several “red lines” – with ostentatious references to Russia’s huge strategic nuclear arsenal – only to seemingly do nothing when these lines are crossed by Ukraine or its Western backers."
